@startuml 浏览和收藏内容时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "首页UI\n(home)" as UI
participant "收藏管理\n(favoriteManager)" as Fav
participant "请求工具\n(request.js)" as Request
participant "云函数\n(api)" as Cloud
database "云数据库" as CloudDB

User -> UI: 下拉刷新
activate UI

UI -> Request: callApi('feed/recommend',\n{page, pageSize})
activate Request

Request -> Cloud: 调用云函数
activate Cloud

Cloud -> CloudDB: 查询内容列表\n(分页/过滤)
activate CloudDB
CloudDB --> Cloud: 返回列表
deactivate CloudDB

Cloud --> Request: 返回数据
deactivate Cloud

Request --> UI: 返回内容列表
deactivate Request

UI -> Fav: 更新收藏状态\n(从本地缓存)
activate Fav
Fav --> UI: 返回状态映射
deactivate Fav

UI --> User: 显示内容
deactivate UI

User -> UI: 点击内容卡片
activate UI

UI -> Request: 记录历史\nrecordHistory()
activate Request
Request -> Cloud: callApi('history/record',\n{contentId, duration})
activate Cloud
Cloud -> CloudDB: 添加历史记录
activate CloudDB
CloudDB --> Cloud: 成功
deactivate CloudDB
Cloud --> Request: 返回
deactivate Cloud
Request --> UI: 返回
deactivate Request

UI --> User: 跳转详情页
deactivate UI

User -> UI: 返回到首页
activate UI
deactivate UI

User -> UI: 点击收藏❤️
activate UI

UI -> Fav: toggleFav(contentId)
activate Fav

Fav -> Request: callApi('user/favorite/toggle',\n{contentId})
activate Request

Request -> Cloud: 调用云函数
activate Cloud

Cloud -> CloudDB: 查询收藏记录
activate CloudDB
CloudDB --> Cloud: 返回记录
deactivate CloudDB

Cloud -> Cloud: 判断是否已收藏
Cloud -> CloudDB: 更新收藏(添加或删除)
activate CloudDB
CloudDB --> Cloud: 返回成功
deactivate CloudDB

Cloud --> Request: 返回{ok: true}
deactivate Cloud

Request --> Fav: 返回结果
deactivate Request

Fav -> Fav: 更新本地缓存\nfavoriteMap
Fav --> UI: 返回新状态
deactivate Fav

UI -> UI: 更新UI\n切换❤️状态
UI --> User: 显示Toast提示
deactivate UI

@enduml

